'''Dorze''' is an [[Afro-Asiatic languages|Afro-Asiatic]] language spoken in the [[Gamo Gofa Zone]] of [[Ethiopia]].<ref name=e25/> Alemayehu Abebe reports that while performing preliminary fieldwork in 1992, he found 14 [[kebele]]s in [[Chencha (woreda)|Chencha]] [[woreda]] with Dorze speakers.<ref>Alemayehu Abebe, [http://www.sil.org/silesr/2002/SILESR2002-068.pdf "Ometo Dialect Pilot Survey Report"] SIL Electronic Survey Reports SILESR 2002-068</ref>

